{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》由莫燦霖師傅帶領黃婧靈（波波）前往筲箕灣，探索一間將懷舊平民滋味與講究工夫菜融會貫通的隱世食府。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蓉玥</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：筲箕灣東大街14-22號東旺樓地下D號舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"aee0ed99-3407-4aa8-a6e0-0814ae3953e1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026JKvu604UfZ1790305261.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"aee0ed99-3407-4aa8-a6e0-0814ae3953e1.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ac959640-1a8c-458a-9a9c-72901995cac1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026GhFG2GvLr41790305260.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ac959640-1a8c-458a-9a9c-72901995cac1.png.webp\"/></div></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7eb955ae-b7fa-4a78-9bd6-f52bf2ce16bd.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026lVXxxIQbGr1790305260.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7eb955ae-b7fa-4a78-9bd6-f52bf2ce16bd.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"621dac18-ed52-4d57-8e73-6c88fe1b1289.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026noeAJ06TEi1790305263.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"621dac18-ed52-4d57-8e73-6c88fe1b1289.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第二站由蔡景行與伍倩彤來到銅鑼灣一間深受圈中明星藝人喜愛的名店。據悉，天王郭富城與太太亦是此店的忠實食客，每次到訪必點「招牌橋底辣蟹」與「避風塘特大瀨尿蝦皇」。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">橋底辣蟹</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：銅鑼灣駱克道391號金禧大廈地舖及1樓</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8c440fe1-f816-44b5-a3f7-e80eb9faaf28.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026fYEmmXaLFH1790305263.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8c440fe1-f816-44b5-a3f7-e80eb9faaf28.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"871672ae-26b2-4123-9b99-e4e54cb063cf.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026FXv0z3gRPO1790305262.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"871672ae-26b2-4123-9b99-e4e54cb063cf.png.webp\"/></div></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"73d76216-4f58-4898-a4d2-ce7b89ff1d3d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026S675WZaBmM1790305262.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"73d76216-4f58-4898-a4d2-ce7b89ff1d3d.png.webp\"/></div></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a5163ed1-fa45-4054-b32a-8ee2383b269c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026YyjeWeNHvZ1790305261.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a5163ed1-fa45-4054-b32a-8ee2383b269c.png.webp\"/></div></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T13:39:07.508968+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}